              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "marjoried"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I just made these with my kids - the were a big hit! If you wanted to make them nut-free you could probably use roasted sunflower seeds (I buy the unsalted kind). Will definitely make these again - nice that not everything for Halloween has to be a cookie or candy!",
            "datePublished": "2013-10-30T03:34:32.597Z"
